,"statementID":"1013616001","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"艾雅在上，当星月落尽朝阳升起，\n请保佑我们踏上坦途。\n请保佑与我并肩作战的同伴。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1013616002:":{"key":"cinematic_dialogue:2:1013616002:","kind":"cinematic_dialogue","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.PlayTimelineNode","statementID":"1013616002","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"时隔多年，那未能寻回圣石之罪，\n我将立誓偿还，不惜代价——","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1013617001:2":{"key":"say:5:1013617001:2","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617001","action_index":"2","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……你到底想付出什么代价？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1013617002:2":{"key":"say:6:1013617002:2","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617002","action_index":"2","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我在做梦吗？阿塔兰忒，你为什么在这里？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1013617003:0":{"key":"say:7:1013617003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你才不会梦到我呢。我就在这里……实实在在的。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1013617004:0":{"key":"say:8:1013617004:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617004","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"还要我说多少次？当年的事，是我的罪，不是你的。但即使再...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1013617005:0":{"key":"say:9:1013617005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你还是不打算告诉我当年的真相吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1013617006:0":{"key":"say:10:1013617006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"明知道我不想说，你为何要问？我应该说过你，别这么不解风情。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1013617007:0":{"key":"say:11:1013617007:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617007","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这不是开玩笑的时候，阿塔兰忒。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1013617008:0":{"key":"say:12:1013617008:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617008","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我从成为骑士的那天起，就立誓守护艾雅。时至今日，我践行...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1013617009:0":{"key":"say:13:1013617009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617009","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但我仍是罪人。因为我的的确确，与世间最卑劣的恶徒一样…...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1013617010:0":{"key":"say:14:1013617010:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617010","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我放你离开了。但你知道的，我也不后悔。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1013617011:0":{"key":"say:15:1013617011:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617011","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我想说与你一样的话，即使再给我一次机会，我也会作出相同...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:16:1013617012:0":{"key":"say:16:1013617012:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"16","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617012","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但……我必须为此赎罪。为了让我的赎罪不至于毫无价值，阿...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:17:1013617013:0":{"key":"say:17:1013617013:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1013617013","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……不，我不能说。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"cinematic_dialogue:20:1013616001:":{"key":"cinematic_dialogue:20:1013616001:","kind":"cinematic_dialogue","source_node_id":"20","source_node_type":"__DT.PlayTimelineNode","statementID":"1013616001","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"艾雅在上，当星月落尽朝阳升起，\n请保佑我们踏上坦途。\n请保佑与我并肩作战的同伴。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"cinematic_dialogue:20:1013616002:":{"key":"cinematic_dialogue:20:1013616002:","kind":"cinematic_dialogue","source_node_id":"20","source_node_type":"__DT.PlayTimelineNode","statementID":"1013616002","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"时隔多年，那未能寻回圣石之罪，\n我将立誓偿还，不惜代价——","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","docume